i.e. use [[Vimeo:32200946]] to embed this video: http://vimeo.com/32200946==Es decir, utilizar [[Vimeo:32200946]] para incrustar este vídeo:http://vimeo.com/32200946
i.e. use [[Youtube:QZsWG4-7Qfk]] to embed this video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QZsWG4-7Qfk==Es decir, utilizar [[Youtube:QZsWG4-7Qfk]] para incrustar este vídeo:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QZsWG4-7Qfk
struck through==golpeada a través de
text<br />&nbsp;text<br />text==texto<br />texto&nbsp;texto<br />
